  - Adds a synchronous fake worker runtime that compiles and executes all three packaged candidate policy modules in fresh namespaces, then uses the real authenticated request/response protocol.
- `tests/test_pit_optimizer_v2.py`
  - Adds nested subscript and attribute `.append` receiver provenance regressions.

